            <div xml:id="m-7578e3fc-9851-4e2e-a9b0-84f52aa1f919">
              <lg xml:id="m-88a6fd1d-b39c-4c24-8249-8448ccbfbe50">
                <l xml:id="m-dc254485-4888-4b5b-81fb-34937fe705d5" facs="#m-832fc468-b22c-4ff9-9d86-1db4ee790a76" label="text-like">And Sunday after Easter.</l><l xml:id="m-95598dde-a08f-4880-b083-7716f524f301" facs="#m-20400247-104f-4de8-8e8e-46d593483def" label="ambiguous">sio</l><l xml:id="m-8da5ab88-c879-426b-9aa8-57063f597e01" facs="#m-d9932dff-be39-434b-9d0a-49a0f9e73f31" label="lyrics-like">le- vá¬</l><l xml:id="m-54884cc6-7f1d-4c3f-a90c-1f64d130d447" facs="#m-ed5fb3a7-95f8-48b4-a605-0c04c9cd9c80" label="lyrics-like">bo má¬ nus mé-as,</l><l xml:id="m-d211f034-a2c3-47a9-a5d4-a84541072c37" facs="#m-73bbeae6-6292-4b0b-8a9e-68416d09a426" label="ambiguous">alle¬</l><l xml:id="m-61a84980-6829-4690-ae6b-337d98fe6e87" facs="#m-60fd5473-d5a3-465b-b7f6-406702fa3417" label="lyrics-like">lú-ia.</l><l xml:id="m-bfab1096-7fc9-49b7-aa14-f9c457edb422" facs="#m-c8114b93-5d96-4984-9537-6db9d4a8f780" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-cfac2427-89c7-4824-a255-0dca8ef34a76" facs="#m-94e38a4f-fab8-4188-9684-95573b8c90f0" label="lyrics-like">2Enedictiónem nobis, Dómine,] virtúte perficiat. Per Dóminum</l><l xml:id="m-a68ac6a0-34c4-4377-803c-2bc510138482" facs="#m-5adeb32a-9f6e-4f72-bacd-d363c74d9c17" label="lyrics-like">A cónferat salutárem sacra sem¬</l><l xml:id="m-e79fe9dc-7836-410f-bf6c-e7e0bd0bd4ba" facs="#m-b759e674-df39-421e-a528-f8e2d8f17fa6" label="ambiguous">nostrum.</l><l xml:id="m-3dcafa3f-0418-430b-9a56-e2b51b1ffa27" facs="#m-f63f56e9-b1c1-4218-9cde-fea2fb693b3a" label="lyrics-like">per oblátio: ut quod agit mystério,</l><l xml:id="m-7fb602c9-71f5-4ca8-bdfa-6b9b903f58ac" facs="#m-7039882f-4554-464b-abed-c3a5eab3c519" label="text-like">2. of our Lady.</l><l xml:id="m-78217226-e6f6-4336-a806-1faf1357bf5a" facs="#m-18b404ff-8db2-43a2-b5be-7b15ba17571f" label="lyrics-like">HIUA, Dómine, propitiatióne, et! praeséntem haec oblátio nobis pro¬</l><l xml:id="m-c4cefe85-20f9-4edd-ad4a-9dc0e5d6f65d" facs="#m-bea0bfeb-c040-46b7-95ef-4b3bcb4435a0" label="lyrics-like">I beátae Mariae semper Virginis</l><l xml:id="m-834224fd-28fd-4787-a377-cf92ebb3ee11" facs="#m-18b58bcb-8806-4ec2-b812-8869f07bbf84" label="lyrics-like">ficiat prosperitátem et pacem.</l><l xml:id="m-d3b973be-4521-47cd-807e-0b8f52ffe0ae" facs="#m-fbdd644f-7d30-46cd-9b1c-e4fa9315291f" label="lyrics-like">intercessióne, ad perpétuam atque</l><l xml:id="m-da1e2237-35fb-4880-9a12-720ba815ac1e" facs="#m-5f291c57-b1cc-43c2-8304-43d7a3999800" label="text-like">3. for the Church or for the Pope, p. 22.</l><l xml:id="m-a6a2899e-9bb0-4c17-9583-c479109e7f4e" facs="#m-d2a87617-d7f0-4d10-b595-ec037b84e5d9" label="text-like">Preface. Easter Sunday. p. 8.</l><l xml:id="m-2b0a1afd-cb58-4f32-9d12-df8ad27fe2d0" facs="#m-dfec557d-2b32-49d3-869d-1efd40272521" label="ambiguous">Comm.</l><l xml:id="m-9073fc05-5dcf-4a2c-ad44-7923312ad3db" facs="#m-4ea021b8-3c86-47da-a42a-48bc91a52ff9" label="ambiguous">2.</l><l xml:id="m-a01523a1-dd58-4970-9884-ba75741bf533" facs="#m-40917eb0-56db-4c14-a207-2e42a3e88d4d" label="lyrics-like">go sum “pástor bó- nus, alle-lú- ia: et co¬</l><l xml:id="m-a2d8b6ad-7da5-44da-afe7-68bf45f263a2" facs="#m-567fe6dc-f154-46f9-9730-10e270dc3f03" label="ambiguous">A</l><l xml:id="m-32f48491-c5f3-4f70-a243-6afb98e9c95a" facs="#m-99c1b0bb-0ad7-4c98-8091-28f6e48fbcc9" label="lyrics-like">gnósco óves mé¬ as, et cognóscunt me mé-ae,</l><l xml:id="m-a20d442b-0d68-489a-9009-6192d331cb32" facs="#m-87b6ed54-5e28-4914-bfd1-8090c60383a2" label="lyrics-like">alle-lú-ia, alle-lú¬ ia.</l><l xml:id="m-22653713-1661-40b0-ac78-6a60e284be04" facs="#m-7ba75302-664c-4997-9cf4-f4ef48a94a94" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-01ed8967-1431-461b-a31b-39029913340d" facs="#m-20f9f0bc-96cc-47b8-ad4e-81944fcbd3eb" label="lyrics-like">ORaesta nobis, quaésumus, omni-l semper múnere gloriémur. Per Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-0cc4acb6-9a8e-4ad5-8070-36b0d8ca3695" facs="#m-6efd48e0-4efb-46c4-aca7-2c177db4bdc1" label="lyrics-like">potens Deus: ut vivificatiónis</l><l xml:id="m-fabb91ca-1645-4b18-8af4-3bb025fb0ed9" facs="#m-9b52aca8-709a-417c-aff8-847d00845c1f" label="ambiguous">minum nostrum.</l><l xml:id="m-f01ff1b1-f168-4d88-88b2-34342ff26582" facs="#m-6a977bd4-4f72-427b-b2b8-a5831d1e17e5" label="lyrics-like">tuae grátiam consequéntes, in tuo</l><l xml:id="m-13cc02ad-6113-4790-9b44-98fa67863aa1" facs="#m-25a86a66-a0d2-4d1c-ad50-b1a2fa2fac29" label="text-like">2 of our Lady.</l><l xml:id="m-6bfa2262-1867-4df3-bb3f-87fb67f3d848" facs="#m-90daa44d-1a86-4423-92a3-b29affd67cdc" label="lyrics-like">QUmptis, Dómine, salútis nostrae[ciniis nos ubique prótegi; in cuius</l><l xml:id="m-e49121aa-fb96-40c3-8e12-c2f405cfb55c" facs="#m-b0a29c87-3a6b-47e8-b3b1-71923d5373df" label="lyrics-like">O subsídiis: da, quaésumus, beá¬</l><l xml:id="m-c0e820f4-3e8f-4087-ace4-a5d62f71f085" facs="#m-026459b0-171b-4661-a948-75a692a81b3d" label="lyrics-like">veneratióne haec tuae obtúlimus</l><l xml:id="m-ece0d48b-4184-4673-b9ec-6fdd7799576b" facs="#m-53f86229-b6d8-433b-83d0-2b1c2ea782c7" label="lyrics-like">tae Mariae semper Virginis patro-l majestáti.</l><l xml:id="m-7ae78aae-a969-493c-8ff6-cf0d495d5c89" facs="#m-2c3eee81-8d19-4320-9a66-7ba9ff96996a" label="text-like">8. for the Church or for the Pope, p. 828.</l><l xml:id="m-334c4b16-db15-4ead-83bd-adc188db2838" facs="#m-b04e6655-8731-4c1b-b004-9a0887d57977" label="text-like">AT SEXT.</l><l xml:id="m-05d7ea60-9833-4728-ac09-e71c0a899ec6" facs="#m-c98328d4-80a4-4fb9-a6d0-19cc613c3300" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-74e710c5-a4d4-4853-aa62-42e8642a5fcb" facs="#m-651122a3-f6a6-44d2-8eda-211fd5aa0ebf" label="ambiguous">1. Petr. 2. d.</l><l xml:id="m-fbb84b9c-f6a4-4c74-a36d-78efccc03d96" facs="#m-cf14bec4-acdc-40e4-8af5-42628ab8ba3f" label="lyrics-like">NIRadébat autem judicánti se in- gnum:ut peccátis mórtui, justitiae</l><l xml:id="m-30cf227a-1ae3-4a66-b42e-114a486ddf0e" facs="#m-e655aa30-5c4a-4621-9aa4-210e8c58bbab" label="lyrics-like">I júste:t qui peccáta nostra ipse l vivámusu livóre sanáti</l><l xml:id="m-a2d2e6ae-0551-4df9-97b0-f65b42142c9a" facs="#m-eab01379-2f4c-456c-857b-3d0effab6ae5" label="lyrics-like">pértulit in córpore suo super li- sumus.</l><l xml:id="m-441e23cc-7111-4692-b238-5c9b395be5ac" facs="#m-cbbb88ef-aa85-4b9e-9334-81bb0941c409" label="lyrics-like">Short Resp. Surréxit Dóminus vere. D. 244.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>